<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine cash Jan wheat firm on export demand.</title>
<headline>Argentine cash Jan wheat firm on export demand.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Short-term export demand pushed up prices and volume for Argentine January cash wheat on Buenos Aires Cereals exchange, dealers said.</p>
<p>Cash maize prices were weighed down by selling pressure while spot maize was steady. Soybean and sunflower prices were both steady on interest from crushers.</p>
<p>--Buenos Aires Newsroom, +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
